      "comment": "bili-cli 原作者 —— 「喂鱼」运营层"
    }
  ],
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/zhikanyeye/dsh-bili-reef.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/zhikanyeye/dsh-bili-reef#readme",
  "bugs": {
